## Tech Stack

| Technology | Purpose |
|---|---|
| React + Tailwind CSS | Frontend UI |
| Node.js + Express | Backend server |
| MongoDB + Mongoose | Database |
| JWT + bcrypt | Authentication |
| Socket.io | Real-time messaging |
| Zustand | State management |
| Groq AI | AI chat assistant |

